// Images: fill modes, adjustments, masks and text over photos
// Shows: placing an image file, fill and fit modes, adjustment presets, a gradient scrim that keeps text readable over a photo, circular and rounded crops by placing the image into a shape (target)
// then: run from the examples folder so assets/sample-scene.jpg resolves
// Foundations: semantic colour variables, then text and effect styles. Interface layers bind to these, never to raw hex; literal colours are for artwork and for data series beyond the brand.
